  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p><strong>• Brand introduction:</strong></p><p>Amaré is a handmade crystal jewelry brand that celebrates self-love, empowerment, and individuality. Our pieces are thoughtfully crafted using natural crystals, designed to be more than just accessories—they are daily companions that remind wearers of their inner strength and courage. Based in Tokyo, Shanghai, and Aarhus, we embrace a modern, mindful lifestyle while honoring the natural beauty of crystals.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>• Product description:</strong></p><p>We offer a collection of <strong>handmade crystal jewelry</strong>, including bracelets and necklaces featuring carefully selected natural stones such as <strong>Amethyst, Moonstone, Rose Quartz, Aquamarine, and Tiger Eye</strong>. Each piece is crafted with intention, blending aesthetics with positive energy to support confidence, healing, and personal growth.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>• USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p><p>• <strong>Handmade with care</strong> – Every piece is crafted by hand, ensuring quality and uniqueness.</p><p>• <strong>Natural crystals with meaning</strong> – Each stone carries energy and significance, connecting wearers to self-love and empowerment.</p><p>• <strong>Modern &amp; versatile design</strong> – Our jewelry seamlessly blends with any outfit, making it a perfect everyday companion.</p><p>• <strong>Eco-conscious values</strong> – We use sustainable packaging and support carbon-neutral shipping.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>• Payment terms:</strong></p><p>• Commission-based earnings for every sale made through your unique affiliate link.</p><p>• Competitive commission rates, starting at 20<strong>% per sale.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>• Other information:</strong></p><p>• Affiliates receive exclusive early access to new collections and special promotions.</p><p>• High-quality marketing materials (images, banners, captions) will be provided.</p><p><br></p></div>